# What the Worker must NOT serve. wrangler uploads the whole directory named in
# wrangler.jsonc `assets.directory` — which is this repo's root — including
# files git does not track. Anything not listed here is world-readable at
# https://kayrali.com/<path> on the next deploy. Deny the repo's plumbing;
# the site is index.html, css/, js/ and the images it references.
.git
.gitignore
.assetsignore
.claude
.DS_Store
System
node_modules
wrangler.jsonc
README.md
*.pdf
